name:           hq-json
version:        0.1.2
synopsis:       A streaming JSON processor inspired by jq, with a lens-based query language.
description:    hq is a JSON processor inspired by jq. It queries JSON with optics
                and rewrites values with transformations, streaming input so large
                documents never load fully into memory.
category:       json,
                cli,
                optics,
                streaming,
                data-processing,
                tools
stability:      experimental
homepage:       https://github.com/damianfral/hq#readme
bug-reports:    https://github.com/damianfral/hq/issues
